WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.691
Rat sat beside Mole on the log.

2
00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:11.521
"When I c-c-called you," cried Mole, "you w-w-wouldn't listen."

3
00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:15.467
Rat patted Mole on the shoulder.

4
00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:18.788
"You d-d-didn't turn back.

5
00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:23.975
I h-h-had to leave it," cried Mole.

6
00:00:23.976 --> 00:00:30.530
"I only wanted to see my home again!"

7
00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:34.481
"I've been so selfish!" said Rat.

8
00:00:34.482 --> 00:00:37.760
"I only cared about my home by the river."

9
00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:40.229
Mole wiped his tears.

10
00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:45.117
"Well," said Rat, "we're going to find your home."

11
00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:46.897
Rat stood up.

12
00:00:46.898 --> 00:00:48.848
"Come along," he said.

13
00:00:48.849 --> 00:00:50.904
"Show me the way."

14
00:00:50.905 --> 00:00:55.771
"Oh Ratty, it's no good," said Mole.

15
00:00:55.772 --> 00:00:59.193
"It will be dark soon."

16
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:02.790
"We will find your place," Rat said.

17
00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:05.634
"Even if we stay out all night."

18
00:01:05.635 --> 00:01:14.086
Rat took Mole's arm, and they walked back.

19
00:01:14.087 --> 00:01:19.255
"I think I smell it, Rat," said Mole.

20
00:01:19.256 --> 00:01:22.813
Mole stopped and raised his nose.

21
00:01:22.814 --> 00:01:25.622
"Well?" asked Rat, excited.

22
00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:29.191
Mole sniffed his way across a field.

23
00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:33.806
He ran this way and that.

24
00:01:33.807 --> 00:01:36.680
"Have you found it, Mole?" asked Rat.

25
00:01:36.681 --> 00:01:40.031
Suddenly Mole dived.

26
00:01:40.032 --> 00:01:43.570
"Where did he go?" said Rat.

27
00:01:43.571 --> 00:01:47.589
Mole poked his head out of a small tunnel.

28
00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:52.176
"It's down here!" Mole said.

29
00:01:52.177 --> 00:01:55.859
Rat dived right behind him.

30
00:01:55.860 --> 00:02:01.167
Down the dark tunnel they went!

